title: Route1Thu2Start
tags: cutscene
---
<<declare $r1_thu2_text = "">>
<<declare $r1_thu2_bottle_seen = false>>
<<declare $r1_thu2_socks_at = "">>
<<declare $r1_thu2_socks_noted = false>>
<<declare $r1_thu2_socks = "">>
<<declare $r1_thu2_wine = "">>
<<declare $r1_thu2_gave = false>>
<<declare $r1_thu2_tulips = false>>
<<declare $r1_thu2_chocolates = false>>
<<declare $r1_thu2_answer = "">>
<<declare $r1_thu2_wine_open = false>>
<<declare $r1_thu2_notebook = "">>
<<declare $r1_thu2_think = "">>
<<declare $r1_thu2_sink = "">>
<<declare $r1_thu2_question = "">>
<<declare $r1_thu2_kiss = "">>
<<declare $r1_thu2_reply = "">>
// Started at the end of Route1Dishes: a week later, he comes home from work.
// The socks are somewhere in 3B, where his answer on Sunday morning put them
// (flat3b_socks.yarn). Her text is waiting on his phone.
<<fade_out>>
<<hide Samantha>>
<<set $item_blush_socks to false>>
<<if $r1_croissant_socks == "yes">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks_at to "drawers">>
<<elseif $r1_croissant_socks == "wash">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks_at to "rack">>
<<else>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks_at to "box">>
<<endif>>
<<place Player PlayerFromShop>>
<<face Player right>>
<<card "Thursday. A week later.">>
<<fade_in>>
<<phone PhoneThursday2>>
You: Home. And my phone's buzzing.
// The player walks freely from here. Knocking on 3A starts Route1Thu2Door (door_3a.yarn).
===
title: Route1Thu2Door
tags: cutscene
---
// Started by knocking on 3A on the second Thursday (door_3a.yarn).
<<walk Player PlayerTo3A>>
<<face Player right>>
<<wait 1>>
<<open_door Door3A>>
<<place Samantha SamanthaOut>>
<<show Samantha>>
<<walk Samantha SamanthaOut>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
{$samantha_name}: Eight o'clock.
<<if not visited("PhoneThursday2")>>
    {$samantha_name}: You didn't read my text.
    You: What text?
    {$samantha_name}: The one that told you what to bring. Too late now.
<<endif>>
// She holds out her hand and waits.
<<jump Route1Thu2Give>>
===
title: Route1Thu2Give
---
// What he hands her at the door. Loops until he says that's all; each give removes the
// item, so the first available option always moves on.
-> Give her the Red Fox 2021 <<if $item_wine_fox>>
    <<set $item_wine_fox to false>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_wine to "fox">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_gave to true>>
    <<if $r1_thu2_bottle_seen>>
        {$samantha_name}: You found the bottle. I put it on top for you.
        -> You planned that?
            {$samantha_name}: I plan most things.
        -> I thought you might have.
            {$samantha_name}: Then you're learning.
    <<elseif visited("PhoneWineChoice")>>
        {$samantha_name}: You kept my text. Good.
    <<else>>
        {$samantha_name}: The right one. Did you guess?
        -> Yes.
            {$samantha_name}: Lucky. I'll take lucky.
        -> I knew.
            {$samantha_name}: You're still a bad liar.
    <<endif>>
    <<jump Route1Thu2Give>>
-> Give her the Red Fox Reserve <<if $item_wine_reserve>>
    <<set $item_wine_reserve to false>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_wine to "reserve">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_gave to true>>
    {$samantha_name}: The gold label.
    <<if visited("PhoneWineChoice")>>
        {$samantha_name}: I said not that one.
    <<endif>>
    {$samantha_name}: Expensive and wrong. I'll drink it anyway.
    <<jump Route1Thu2Give>>
-> Give her the house red <<if $item_wine_house>>
    <<set $item_wine_house to false>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_wine to "house">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_gave to true>>
    {$samantha_name}: This is what you'd want.
    {$samantha_name}: It'll do for the sauce.
    <<jump Route1Thu2Give>>
-> Give her the tulips <<if $item_tulips>>
    <<set $item_tulips to false>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_tulips to true>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_gave to true>>
    {$samantha_name}: I said what I'd want. Not what you think I'd want.
    {$samantha_name}: ...I'll put them in water.
    <<jump Route1Thu2Give>>
-> Give her the chocolate <<if $item_chocolates>>
    <<set $item_chocolates to false>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_chocolates to true>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_gave to true>>
    {$samantha_name}: Bribery. Noted.
    <<jump Route1Thu2Give>>
-> Give her the blush socks <<if $item_blush_socks>>
    <<set $item_blush_socks to false>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks to "pocket">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_gave to true>>
    {$samantha_name}: I don't want them.
    {$samantha_name}: I want them on you. Here. Now.
    You: On your doormat?
    {$samantha_name}: On my doormat.
    // He puts them on.
    {$samantha_name}: Better. Next time they're on before you knock.
    <<jump Route1Thu2Give>>
-> That's everything. <<if $r1_thu2_gave>>
    <<jump Route1Thu2Shoes>>
-> Hi. <<if not $r1_thu2_gave>>
    <<if $item_wine_fox or $item_wine_reserve or $item_wine_house or $item_tulips or $item_chocolates or $item_blush_socks>>
        {$samantha_name}: Your hands. Not your mouth.
        <<jump Route1Thu2Give>>
    <<else>>
        {$samantha_name}: Empty-handed.
        {$samantha_name}: Bold.
        <<jump Route1Thu2Shoes>>
    <<endif>>
===
title: Route1Thu2Shoes
---
{$samantha_name}: Come in. Shoes off.
// She looks down at his feet.
<<if $r1_thu2_socks == "on">>
    {$samantha_name}: There.
    {$samantha_name}: That's what I wanted.
    <<if $r1_thu2_wine == "fox">>
        <<set $r1_thu2_answer to "full">>
        {$samantha_name}: Both. You worked it out.
    <<else>>
        <<set $r1_thu2_answer to "socks">>
        {$samantha_name}: You worked out the part that mattered.
    <<endif>>
<<elseif $r1_thu2_socks == "pocket">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_answer to "socks">>
    {$samantha_name}: Blush. Finally.
<<elseif $item_blush_socks>>
    <<set $item_blush_socks to false>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks to "pocket">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_answer to "socks">>
    {$samantha_name}: Grey. And what's in your pocket?
    You: ...
    {$samantha_name}: You brought them and didn't wear them. Put them on. Here.
    // He puts them on, on her doormat.
    {$samantha_name}: Blush. Finally.
<<else>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks to "off">>
    <<if $r1_thu2_wine == "fox">>
        <<set $r1_thu2_answer to "wine">>
    <<else>>
        <<set $r1_thu2_answer to "none">>
    <<endif>>
    {$samantha_name}: Grey.
    {$samantha_name}: You thought this was about wine.
    You: Wasn't it?
    {$samantha_name}: Some of it.
<<endif>>
<<note_done thu2>>
<<if $r1_thu2_bottle_seen>>
    <<note_done thu2_wine>>
<<endif>>
<<if $r1_thu2_socks_noted>>
    <<note_done thu2_socks>>
<<endif>>
// She goes back to her stove; he follows her in.
<<walk Samantha SamanthaToKitchen3A no_wait>>
<<walk Player PlayerInto3A>>
<<await_walks>>
<<close_door Door3A>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
<<if $r1_thu2_wine != "">>
    {$samantha_name}: Open the wine. The corkscrew's in the drawer by the sink.
    <<note thu2_cork "Open her wine. Corkscrew: the drawer by her sink.">>
<<else>>
    {$samantha_name}: Sit. It's nearly ready.
<<endif>>
// The player walks around her flat. Sitting at the table starts Route1Thu2Dinner (table_3a.yarn).
===
title: Route1Thu2Dinner
tags: cutscene
---
// Started by sitting down at her table on the second Thursday (table_3a.yarn).
<<place Player PlayerSit>>
<<walk Samantha SamanthaSit>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
{$samantha_name}: Risotto. Not pasta. You'd get used to it.
{$samantha_name}: A game while we eat. I ask, you answer. Honestly.
{$samantha_name}: You get one question back.
You: And if I lie?
{$samantha_name}: I'll know. You saw how that went on Sunday.
{$samantha_name}: Did you think about me this week?
-> Yes.
    <<set $r1_thu2_think to "yes">>
    {$samantha_name}: Good.
-> No.
    <<set $r1_thu2_think to "no">>
    {$samantha_name}: You're a bad liar. I've said that before.
-> More than I'd like.
    <<set $r1_thu2_think to "more">>
    {$samantha_name}: That's the right amount.
<<if $r1_dishes_turn == "turned">>
    {$samantha_name}: Last week at the sink. I said don't turn around, and you did. Why?
    -> I wanted to see you.
        <<set $r1_thu2_sink to "see">>
        {$samantha_name}: You could have waited. Next time, wait.
    -> I don't like being told.
        <<set $r1_thu2_sink to "told">>
        {$samantha_name}: Yes you do. You just don't like that you do.
<<else>>
    {$samantha_name}: Last week at the sink. When I told you not to turn around.
    {$samantha_name}: What did that feel like?
    -> Easy.
        <<set $r1_thu2_sink to "easy">>
        {$samantha_name}: Mm. It was meant to.
    -> Strange. Good strange.
        <<set $r1_thu2_sink to "good">>
        {$samantha_name}: I'll write that down later.
    -> I didn't like it.
        <<set $r1_thu2_sink to "disliked">>
        {$samantha_name}: You did it anyway.
<<endif>>
{$samantha_name}: Your turn. One question.
-> What else is in the notebook?
    <<set $r1_thu2_question to "notebook">>
    {$samantha_name}: Seven pages. You're on four of them.
    You: Four?
    {$samantha_name}: That was your question.
-> Why me?
    <<set $r1_thu2_question to "why">>
    {$samantha_name}: Because you answer the door.
-> Where's your father?
    <<set $r1_thu2_question to "father">>
    {$samantha_name}: Lisbon. Back in a few weeks. He leaves the building to me.
    You: The building.
    {$samantha_name}: And everyone in it.
-> Have you done this before?
    <<set $r1_thu2_question to "before">>
    {$samantha_name}: Done what?
    You: ...This.
    {$samantha_name}: Not like this.
{$samantha_name}: Leave the dishes. Tonight you're done when I say you're done.
{$samantha_name}: And I say you're done.
// She walks him to her door and stops him there.
<<walk Samantha SamanthaKiss3A no_wait>>
<<walk Player PlayerKiss3A>>
<<await_walks>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
{$samantha_name}: Stand there. Hands by your sides.
{$samantha_name}: Don't move.
-> Stay still.
    <<set $r1_thu2_kiss to "still">>
    // She kisses him. Short. She steps back first.
    <<wait 1>>
    {$samantha_name}: Good boy.
    You: ...
    {$samantha_name}: You heard me.
-> Reach for her.
    <<set $r1_thu2_kiss to "reached">>
    // She catches his wrist, puts his hand back by his side, and kisses him anyway.
    {$samantha_name}: Hands.
    <<wait 1>>
    {$samantha_name}: There. Was that so hard?
-> Samantha...
    <<set $r1_thu2_kiss to "spoke">>
    {$samantha_name}: I said don't move. That includes talking.
    // Then the kiss.
    <<wait 1>>
    {$samantha_name}: Better.
<<open_door Door3A>>
<<walk Player PlayerOutOf3AKiss>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
{$samantha_name}: Goodnight, neighbour.
<<close_door Door3A>>
<<hide Samantha>>
<<wait 1>>
// Home.
<<face Player up>>
<<open_door Door3B>>
<<walk Player PlayerInto3B>>
<<face Player down>>
<<close_door Door3B>>
<<wait 1>>
<<phone PhoneThursday2Night>>
You: ...My phone. Already.
// The player is in control in 3B. Going to bed after reading her text starts
// Route1Thu2End (bed_3b.yarn).
===
title: Route1Thu2End
tags: cutscene
---
// Started by going to bed after her night text (bed_3b.yarn).
<<fade_out>>
<<card "Thursdays.">>
<<end_demo>>
===
